1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,213
So every month, we read both documents and compare them.

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:06,082
A hundred and forty-nine matched.

3
00:00:06,082 --> 00:00:09,162
Three spelled differently in the two systems.

4
00:00:09,162 --> 00:00:11,237
Two with no life cover at all.

5
00:00:11,237 --> 00:00:16,430
And eight hundred and forty-five dollars in premium, paid on someone who had already left.

